{"id":"fc340e3da8f531c3","group":"88","path":"88/88-prop-mu-extension.md","title":"Mu-operator Extends PR","display":"prop-mu-extension — Mu-operator Extends PR","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-prop-mu-extension","aliases":["88-prop-mu-extension"],"display":"prop-mu-extension — Mu-operator Extends PR","depends_on":["[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[88-df-mu-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-prop-mu-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-prop-mu-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-mu-extension — Mu-operator Extends PR"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (number-theoretic function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)\\)</span> (primitive-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\\)</span> (mu-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf4e721d88316525\" href=\"?note=bf4e721d88316525\" title=\"88-df-mu-recursive\">88-df-mu-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mu\\text{-}extension} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mu\\text{-}extension} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>这里比较的是两个函数谓词，而不是把操作符<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>误当成一个函数类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-算子扩充原始递归函数</li>\n<li>Ackermann函数是该包含在总函数部分严格的证据</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-mu-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)$ (primitive-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"bf4e721d88316525","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)$ (mu-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-mu-recursive]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}mu\\text{-}extension} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}(f)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{MuRec}(f)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":874,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2f808bc294509a7d","bf4e721d88316525"]}